{"id":"wb-3-126","name":"西岳庙","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"西岳庙","text":"西岳庙位于中华人民共和国陕西省渭南市华阴市岳庙街道，又称华岳庙，是祭祀西岳华山的场所，1988年被列为第三批全国重点文物保护单位。\n西汉元光元年（公元前134年）建集灵宫于黄甫峪口，东汉时迁于现址，后改称西岳庙。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%A5%BF%E5%B2%B3%E5%BA%99","revisionId":91314403,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=91314403","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/f3a4ba0f861c3e104d615c3c.jpg","title":"西岳庙.JPG","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E8%A5%BF%E5%B2%B3%E5%BA%99.JPG","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/82/%E8%A5%BF%E5%B2%B3%E5%BA%99.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Acstar","license":"CC BY 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0","caption":"​西岳庙庙门。","width":320,"height":213}}